SUMMARY:Tapacapalooza II 2026
LOCATION:Trinity Alps Performing Arts Center\, 30 Arbuckle Ct\, Weavervill
 e\, CA
DESCRIPTION:A music festival celebrating local Trinity County bands\, pres
 ented by The Trinity Players. Lineup: Miles Tralle\, Cali Rockin' Blues\,
  Cup of Joe's\, Very Bold Rats\, Nate\, Taylor and Marcio\, Bohemian Muse
 \, Shiitake Sultan\, RXR\, Ladies of the Canyon and Amateur Cadaver\, on 
 the Lobby and Main stages. All are welcome. Entrance by donation\, pay wh
 at you can.
END:VEVENT
